'''Dark wizards''' are [[Zamorak]]ian mages that attack with low-level magic. They can be primarily found around the [[Varrock stone circle]] and in the [[Dark Wizards' Tower]], and are notable for frequently dropping runes, as well as [[black robes]] and [[wizard hat]]s. They are also notable for being a considerable threat to very low level players due to their relatively high max hit for their combat level and position next to the southern entrance of [[Varrock]].

They play a small role in the [[Demon Slayer]] [[quest]], performing a ritual to summon the demon [[Delrith]].

The wizards attack with a variety of spells. The level 7 variant will attack with [[Water Strike]] and [[Confuse]] spells, while the level 20 variant will attack with [[Earth Strike]] and [[Weaken]] spells.

